# tech stack lewagon

- Ruby on Rails for the backend

- ERB + HTML/JS for the frontend

- PostgreSQL as the database

- Separate environments for development, test, and production

- Bootstrap 5.2 for styling

- Devise for authentication

- Elasticsearch (via elasticsearch-model and elasticsearch-rails) for search

- dotenv for environment variable management

- Simple Form for forms

- SassC and Autoprefixer for CSS preprocessing

- Font Awesome for icons

- Unit tests using Rails' default test framework (test_unit)

- Heroku-compatible configuration